{"id":"341b5a5ae2ec5b04","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-convex-set.md","title":"Convex Set","display":"df-convex-set — Convex Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-convex-set","aliases":["58-df-convex-set","Convex Set"],"display":"df-convex-set — Convex Set","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-convex-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-convex-set</span><span>Convex Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-convex-set — Convex Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,+,\\cdot\\in V\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+,\\cdot)\">\\(V,+,\\cdot\\in V\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+,\\cdot)\\)</span> (real-vector-space structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq V\">\\(C\\subseteq V\\)</span> (subset parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (convexity for designated vector-space operations, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Convex}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Convex}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (carrier-only existential compatibility predicate, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convex-set\\text{-}structured} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(C,V,+,\\cdot) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+,\\cdot)\\land C\\subseteq V \\land \\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\forall \\lambda\\in[0,1]\\;((1-\\lambda)x+\\lambda y\\in C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convex-set\\text{-}structured} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(C,V,+,\\cdot) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+,\\cdot)\\land C\\subseteq V \\land \\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\forall \\lambda\\in[0,1]\\;((1-\\lambda)x+\\lambda y\\in C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convex-set\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{Convex}_S(C,V)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +,\\cdot\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(C,V,+,\\cdot)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convex-set\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{Convex}_S(C,V)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +,\\cdot\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(C,V,+,\\cdot)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S\\)</span> is the truth-preserving form when downstream statements already carry designated vector operations; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Convex}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Convex}_S\\)</span> only records existence of a compatible real-vector-space structure.</li>\n<li>Convex: line segment between any two points lies in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span></li>\n<li>Convex hull: smallest convex set containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{conv}(C) = \\{\\sum \\lambda_i x_i : x_i \\in C, \\lambda_i \\geq 0, \\sum \\lambda_i = 1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{conv}(C) = \\{\\sum \\lambda_i x_i : x_i \\in C, \\lambda_i \\geq 0, \\sum \\lambda_i = 1\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Polyhedral sets and half-space intersections are downstream refinements of convex sets.</li>\n<li>Hahn-Banach: separation of convex sets by hyperplanes</li>\n<li>Carathéodory: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{conv}(C) = \\{\\sum_{i=1}^{d+1} \\lambda_i x_i\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{conv}(C) = \\{\\sum_{i=1}^{d+1} \\lambda_i x_i\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rockafellar, Convex Analysis</li>\n<li>Boyd and Vandenberghe, Convex Optimization</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V,+,\\cdot\\in V\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+,\\cdot)$ (real-vector-space structure, see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,+,\\cdot\\in V\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Convex}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convex-set\\text{-}structured} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(C,V,+,\\cdot) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(V,+,\\cdot)\\land C\\subseteq V \\land \\forall x,y\\in C\\;\\forall \\lambda\\in[0,1]\\;((1-\\lambda)x+\\lambda y\\in C)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convex-set\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{Convex}_S(C,V)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +,\\cdot\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(C,V,+,\\cdot)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Convex}_S","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{conv}(C) = \\{\\sum \\lambda_i x_i : x_i \\in C, \\lambda_i \\geq 0, \\sum \\lambda_i = 1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{conv}(C) = \\{\\sum_{i=1}^{d+1} \\lambda_i x_i\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1851,"backlinks":[{"id":"aa0209ba799780d1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ and $\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ are the exact structured predicates from [[58-df-compact]] and [[58-df-convex-set]]"},{"id":"4a5a98838569525e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S$ 使用 [[../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md]] 的四元结构式凸性谓词。"},{"id":"e23036035ed4df55","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-368","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md|58-df-convex-set]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["592f9cfb66a507c2"]}